---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Python 速算台"
  description="粘贴 Python 代码，本地毫秒级转译执行：语法高亮、行号、Ctrl+Enter 运行；零依赖零上传，离线可用"
>
  <h1>🐍 Python 速算台</h1>

  <div class="intro">
    <p><b>粘贴即跑的本地 Python 执行器</b>：把代码贴进编辑器，点「运行」或 <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>+<kbd>Enter</kbd> 立即执行。<b>代码不上传任何服务器</b>——运行由本站自研的 py2js 引擎在浏览器内完成（毫秒级静态转译，无需下载运行时）。草稿自动保存在浏览器本地，刷新不丢。</p>
    <p class="muted">⚙️ 支持 Python 常用子集：变量 / 流程控制 / 函数 / 类 / 列表字典 / 推导式 / f-string / import math 等；不支持第三方库、input() 交互与 open() 文件读写。「查看 JS」可看到转译产物。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="editor">
    <div id="gutter" class="gutter" aria-hidden="true">1</div>
    <div class="hl-wrap">
      <pre class="hl" id="hl" aria-hidden="true"><code></code></pre>
      <textarea
        id="code"
        spellcheck="false"
        autocapitalize="off"
        autocomplete="off"
        placeholder="粘贴或输入 Python 代码…（Ctrl+Enter 运行）"
        aria-label="Python 代码"
      ></textarea>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="statusbar">
    <span id="stPos">1:1</span>
    <span class="grow"></span>
    <span id="stPy">py2js 未加载 · 运行时自动加载</span>
  </div>

  <div class="toolbar">
    <button id="btnRun" class="btn run">▶ 运行 <span class="kbd">Ctrl↵</span></button>
    <button id="btnViewJs" class="btn ghost">查看 JS</button>
    <button id="btnDemo" class="btn ghost">示例</button>
    <button id="btnClear" class="btn ghost">清空输出</button>
    <span id="elapsed" class="elapsed"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="output">
    <div id="out"><div class="out-empty">输出显示在这里。粘贴代码后按 Ctrl+Enter 或点「运行」。</div></div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .intro {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 14px 18px;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .intro p { margin: 0.3em 0; font-size: 0.94rem; }
  .intro .muted { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.86rem; }
  .intro kbd {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 5px;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
  }

  .editor { display: flex; min-height: 320px; margin-top: 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--bg-soft); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .gutter {
    flex: none;
    width: 46px;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 14px 10px 14px 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: right;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    opacity: 0.55;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    user-select: none;
    white-space: pre;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .hl-wrap { position: relative; flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
  .hl-wrap pre.hl {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    tab-size: 4;
    color: var(--fg);
    pointer-events: none;
    overflow: hidden;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-word;
  }
  pre.hl code { font: inherit; }
  .editor textarea {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    resize: none;
    border: none;
    outline: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: transparent;
    caret-color: var(--fg);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    tab-size: 4;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }
  .editor textarea::placeholder { color: var(--fg-muted); opacity: 0.7; }
  .tok-kw { color: #8b5cf6; font-weight: 600; }
  .tok-str { color: #b45309; }
  .tok-com { color: var(--fg-muted); font-style: italic; }
  .tok-num { color: #0284c7; }
  .tok-bi { color: #0d9488; }
  .tok-cl { color: #db2777; }

  .statusbar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 7px 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .statusbar .grow { flex: 1; }
  #stPy.ready { color: #16a34a; }
  #stPy.error { color: #dc2626; }

  .toolbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 12px 0; }
  .btn {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    padding: 8px 16px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .btn.run { background: var(--accent); border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
  .btn.run:hover { color: #fff; filter: brightness(1.08); }
  .btn.ghost { background: var(--bg-soft); }
  .kbd {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    opacity: 0.75;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0 4px;
    margin-left: 4px;
  }
  .elapsed { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.82rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); margin-left: auto; }

  .output {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    min-height: 120px;
    max-height: 480px;
    overflow: auto;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
  }
  .out-empty { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }
  .out-line {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    word-break: break-all;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .out-line.err { color: #dc2626; }
  .out-line.ok { color: var(--fg); }
  .out-line.sys { color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 0.8rem; }
  .js-view {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    overflow: auto;
    max-height: 380px;
    white-space: pre;
    margin: 6px 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .editor { min-height: 260px; }
    .gutter { width: 38px; padding-right: 6px; }
    .btn { padding: 10px 14px; }
  }
</style>

<script>
  // py-ide 精简版（粘贴即跑）：单缓冲 + 高亮 + 本地草稿；文件系统/多标签见 git 历史版本
  import { hlPython } from '../../scripts/py-ide/highlight.js';

  const $ = (id) => document.getElementById(id);
  const codeEl = $('code');
  const hlEl = $('hl');
  const hlCode = hlEl.querySelector('code');
  const gutter = $('gutter');
  const outEl = $('out');
  const elapsedEl = $('elapsed');
  const stPos = $('stPos');
  const stPy = $('stPy');
  const btnRun = $('btnRun');
  const btnViewJs = $('btnViewJs');
  const btnDemo = $('btnDemo');
  const btnClear = $('btnClear');

  const LS_KEY = 'pyide-scratch';
  let pyState = 'idle'; // idle | loading | ready | error

  const msg = (e) => (e && e.message ? e.message : String(e));

  // ---- 输出面板 ----
  function clearEmpty() {
    const empty = outEl.querySelector('.out-empty');
    if (empty) empty.remove();
  }
  function addLine(text, cls) {
    clearEmpty();
    const p = document.createElement('div');
    p.className = 'out-line ' + (cls || 'ok');
    p.textContent = text;
    outEl.appendChild(p);
    outEl.scrollTop = outEl.scrollHeight;
  }
  const sysLine = (t) => addLine(t, 'sys');
  function addPre(text) {
    clearEmpty();
    const pre = document.createElement('pre');
    pre.className = 'js-view';
    pre.textContent = text;
    outEl.appendChild(pre);
    outEl.scrollTop = outEl.scrollHeight;
  }

  // ---- py2js 引擎 ----
  function setPyStatus() {
    stPy.className = pyState;
    stPy.textContent =
      pyState === 'ready' ? 'py2js 就绪'
      : pyState === 'loading' ? 'py2js 加载中…'
      : pyState === 'error' ? 'py2js 加载失败'
      : 'py2js 未加载 · 运行时自动加载';
  }
  function ensurePy(then) {
    if (window.PY2JS) {
      if (pyState !== 'ready') {
        pyState = 'ready';
        setPyStatus();
      }
      then();
      return;
    }
    if (pyState === 'error') {
      sysLine('py2js 转译器此前加载失败，请刷新页面重试');
      return;
    }
    pyState = 'loading';
    setPyStatus();
    const s = document.createElement('script');
    const base = String((import.meta.env.BASE_URL || '/')).replace(/\/?$/, '/');
    s.src = new URL(base + 'assets/py2js.bundle.js', document.baseURI).href;
    s.onload = () => {
      if (window.PY2JS) {
        pyState = 'ready';
        setPyStatus();
        then();
      } else {
        pyState = 'error';
        setPyStatus();
        addLine('py2js 加载异常：PY2JS 全局不可用', 'err');
      }
    };
    s.onerror = () => {
      pyState = 'error';
      setPyStatus();
      addLine('py2js 转译器脚本加载失败（' + base + 'assets/py2js.bundle.js）', 'err');
    };
    document.head.appendChild(s);
  }

  function doRun(src) {
    const P = window.PY2JS;
    const t0 = performance.now();
    let r = null;
    try {
      r = P.runPython(src);
    } catch (e) {
      addLine('运行异常: ' + msg(e), 'err');
      return;
    }
    const tMs = performance.now() - t0;
    if (r && r.errors && r.errors.length) {
      r.errors.forEach((e) => addLine((e.line ? '第 ' + e.line + ' 行: ' : '') + (e.message != null ? e.message : e.msg), 'err'));
      elapsedEl.textContent = '失败 · ' + tMs.toFixed(1) + ' ms';
      return;
    }
    const out = (r && r.out) || '';
    if (out.length) out.split('\n').forEach((l) => addLine(l, 'ok'));
    else addLine('(无输出)', 'sys');
    elapsedEl.textContent = '转译+运行 ' + tMs.toFixed(1) + ' ms';
  }

  function run() {
    const src = codeEl.value;
    if (!src.trim()) {
      sysLine('编辑器是空的——粘贴代码后再运行');
      return;
    }
    ensurePy(() => doRun(src));
  }

  function viewJs() {
    const src = codeEl.value;
    if (!src.trim()) {
      sysLine('编辑器是空的——先粘贴代码');
      return;
    }
    ensurePy(() => {
      const r = window.PY2JS.transpile(src);
      if (r.errors && r.errors.length) {
        r.errors.forEach((e) => addLine('行 ' + e.line + ': ' + (e.msg != null ? e.msg : e.message), 'err'));
        return;
      }
      addPre(r.body || '(空)');
      elapsedEl.textContent = '转译产物 ' + ((r.body || '').length / 1024).toFixed(1) + ' KB';
    });
  }

  // ---- 编辑器同步 ----
  function syncHl() {
    hlCode.innerHTML = hlPython(codeEl.value) + '\n';
  }
  function syncGutter() {
    const n = codeEl.value.split('\n').length;
    let h = '';
    for (let i = 1; i <= n; i++) h += i + '\n';
    gutter.textContent = h;
  }
  function updatePos() {
    const s = codeEl.selectionStart || 0;
    const rows = codeEl.value.slice(0, s).split('\n');
    stPos.textContent = rows.length + ':' + (rows[rows.length - 1].length + 1);
  }
  function refreshEditorUI() {
    syncHl();
    syncGutter();
    updatePos();
  }
  function saveDraft() {
    try { localStorage.setItem(LS_KEY, codeEl.value); } catch (_) { /* 忽略配额错误 */ }
  }

  // ---- 示例 ----
  const DEMO_SRC = `import math

# py2js：毫秒级转译执行 Python 常用子集
def fib(n):
    a, b = 0, 1
    for _ in range(n):
        a, b = b, a + b
    return a

print("斐波那契前 10 项:", [fib(i) for i in range(10)])

d = {"x": 3.14, "names": ["心屿", "py2js"]}
print(f"圆周率≈{d['x']:.2f}, 共 {len(d['names'])} 项")
print("sqrt(2) =", round(math.sqrt(2), 6))
`;

  // ---- 事件绑定 ----
  codeEl.addEventListener('input', () => {
    refreshEditorUI();
    saveDraft();
  });
  codeEl.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
    hlEl.scrollTop = codeEl.scrollTop;
    hlEl.scrollLeft = codeEl.scrollLeft;
    gutter.scrollTop = codeEl.scrollTop;
  });
  codeEl.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
    if ((e.ctrlKey || e.metaKey) && e.key === 'Enter') {
      e.preventDefault();
      run();
      return;
    }
    // Tab 插入 4 空格（Shift+Tab 缩进一级略，保持简单）
    if (e.key === 'Tab') {
      e.preventDefault();
      const s = codeEl.selectionStart;
      const epos = codeEl.selectionEnd;
      codeEl.value = codeEl.value.slice(0, s) + '    ' + codeEl.value.slice(epos);
      codeEl.selectionStart = codeEl.selectionEnd = s + 4;
      refreshEditorUI();
      saveDraft();
    }
  });
  btnRun.addEventListener('click', run);
  btnViewJs.addEventListener('click', viewJs);
  btnDemo.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (codeEl.value.trim() && !window.confirm('载入示例将覆盖当前编辑器内容，继续？')) return;
    codeEl.value = DEMO_SRC;
    refreshEditorUI();
    saveDraft();
    codeEl.focus();
  });
  btnClear.addEventListener('click', () => {
    outEl.innerHTML = '<div class="out-empty">输出已清空。</div>';
    elapsedEl.textContent = '';
  });

  // ---- 初始化：恢复草稿 ----
  try {
    const saved = localStorage.getItem(LS_KEY);
    if (saved) codeEl.value = saved;
  } catch (_) { /* 忽略 */ }
  refreshEditorUI();
  codeEl.focus();
</script>
